{
  "//": "第二十六輪（issue #42）型別檢查試點：只檢查下面 include 的檔案（JS + JSDoc，不改成 TypeScript）。要擴大範圍就把檔案加進 include 並在檔首加 // @ts-check。",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": false,
    "noImplicitAny": false,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["scripts/lib/lanes.mjs", "scripts/lib/validate.mjs", "scripts/lib/gateway/*.mjs"]
}
